1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,550
My Caltrain is ten minutes late. Should I still take it?

2
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:09,780
Headway says no: wait for the Express. It gets me there first.

3
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:12,780
It is right on my glasses, too.

4
00:00:13,130 --> 00:00:17,230
And it pings me, before I board the slow one.

5
00:00:17,390 --> 00:00:21,230
Headway. Your next Caltrain, at a glance.
